<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merit Holding started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merit Holding started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it started coverage of Merit Holding Corp with a buy rating</p>
<p>-- Analyst John Mason has 12-18 month price target of $3/shr</p>
<p>-- Analyst cites strong management team at Marietta, Ga.-based banking company, rap;id expansion</p>
<p>-- Merit unchanged at 10-3/4 in morning trade</p>
</text>
